<title>USA: Suzuki September US vehicle sales rise.</title>
<headline>Suzuki September US vehicle sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		  81		 352	    -76.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,030	     1,064	    +98.7</p>
<p> Import Car		   686		 405	    +76.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,263		 658	    +99.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     2,522	     2,883	    -12.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   8,590	    10,699	    -20.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,984	     2,118	   +134.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	    11,865	     7,986	    +47.9</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
